Global catalyst markets are $20+ billion today.  

Clean energy and more energy is a global requirement as countries industrialize. 


More efficient processes for generation, storage, and usage of energy can be 
enabled by nano catalysts, resulting in lower cost and less pollution.  Conference 
presents commercializable research, leading edge Silicon Valley start-ups, and 
