Design, Synthesis & Applications Conference
Westin Hotel, Pasadena, CA 

The conference will focus on the state-of-the art in Devices and Systems, Nanoscale 
Phenomena, and Nano manufacturing with consist of 
plenary talks, panel discussions, paper and poster presentations. 

http://www.asmeconferences.org/nano04/
 
*********************************************************************************
October 26th:  Leading Edge NanoElectronics & Photonics Conference 
Townsend & Townsend, 379 Lytton Avenue Palo Alto, CA  
 
FOURTH bi-annual conference featuring leading edge developments in the commercialization 
of nanoElectronics & Photonics. Speakers drawn from:
> Nanostructured materials with Novel Photonic and/or Electronic Properties; 
 
> Nanoprinting, Imprinting, "Soft" Lithography, & Molecular Deposition; 
> Molecular Switches, Gates and Sensors; 
